# Copy to .env and edit, then `docker compose up -d` (or ./rebuild.sh).
# docker compose reads .env from this directory by itself.

# Where the board's cards come from:
#
#   claude   Claude is told, in every session, to plan any work that takes more
#            than one step as tasks and keep their status current. The cards
#            are Claude's own tasks. This is the default.
#            With Codex hooks installed, update_plan steps are mirrored too.
#
#   prompts  Every prompt you send Claude is a card: IN PROGRESS while Claude
#            works on it, DONE when it stops. Claude's own tasks are not put on
#            the board in this mode.
#            Codex hooks use the same mode: submitted prompt to Stop.
TASKTRACKER_CARDS=claude
